Findings
High — still not agent-agnostic beyond Claude/Cursor-style JSONL (cmd/entire/cli/transcript/compact.go)
The new aliasing fixes role:user/assistant and type:human, but conversion still assumes a Claude/Cursor-shaped line with top-level message and timestamp.
For agents with different transcript schema (e.g. Gemini JSON messages with type:"gemini" and top-level content, or Factory AI Droid’s type:"message" envelope), entries will still be dropped or serialized with missing fields.

