}
type GeminiMessage struct {
    ID      string `json:"id,omitempty"`
    Type    string `json:"type"` // user or gemini
    Content string `json:"content,omitempty"`
}
Medium — user text still bypasses IDE context tag stripping (cmd/entire/cli/transcript/compact.go)
Compact output includes raw user text; existing transcript parsing paths sanitize with StripIDEContextTags. This can leak noisy IDE context tags into compacted output.

